@CaseTrack.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5286

### 1. 取得開發用的 token（只有 Development 環境有這個端點）
# @name devToken
POST {{CaseTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "u-officer-1",
  "name": "王承辦",
  "roles": ["CaseOfficer"],
  "departmentId": "PWD"
}

### 2. 送出陳情（不需要登入）
# @name submitCase
POST {{CaseTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "路燈不亮",
  "content": "中山路路燈故障",
  "petitioner": { "name": "王小明", "phone": "0912345678" }
}

### 3. 查詢案件（帶上第 1 步的 token）
GET {{CaseTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cases/{{submitCase.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4. 沒帶 token → 401
GET {{CaseTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cases/{{submitCase.response.body.$.id}}
